{
  "$comment": [
    "Theme definitions for documd-visuals. Repo-only source of truth: `build-themes.mjs` renders",
    "skills/documd-visuals/styles/themes/<id>.md from this file, and `--check` fails when a shipped",
    "theme file drifts from it. Never hand-edit the shipped theme files.",
    "",
    "A theme assigns a *value* to every token the palette contract declares, and may narrow a token's",
    "allowed uses where the theme's ground makes a use impossible — a family light enough to be a",
    "pleasant band is too light to clear 4.5 as text or 3.0 as a line on any light page. Uses are",
    "never widened. Every theme's ground is a light page: the set has no dark ground, by decision.",
    "",
    "token entry: [value, uses, textOn]",
    "  uses    one or more of t (text) l (line) f (fill); '' = none",
    "  textOn  the colour allowed to sit *on* this token when used as a fill: a hex, a token name,",
    "          or omitted when no text may sit on it",
    "",
    "derived values are computed by the generator, never hand-written:",
    "  tint-<family>   mix(ground, family, 18%)   — the family's panel fill",
    "  shade-<family>  darken(family, 12%)        — its border",
    "The mix base is the theme's *ground*, not a surface: mixing into a tinted near-white drags every",
    "hue towards the same grey and the tints stop being tellable apart (measured, see palette.md)."
  ],
  "contract": {
    "$comment": [
      "What each token *is*, independent of any theme: its role, what it may sit on, and the",
      "widest set of uses it may ever be granted (`max`). A theme assigns values and narrows uses",
      "within `max` — it can never widen them. `max` exists because some families are structurally",
      "incapable of a use in any theme: an amber that is light enough to be a pleasant band is too",
      "light to be text or a line, on any ground."
    ],
    "ink": {
      "max": "t",
      "sitsOn": "surface-*, tint-*",
      "role": "body text inside fills, headings, node labels"
    },
    "ink-soft": {
      "max": "t",
      "sitsOn": "page",
      "role": "secondary body text on an unfilled background"
    },
    "muted": {
      "max": "t",
      "sitsOn": "page",
      "role": "captions, axes tick labels, metadata — never inside a tinted fill"
    },
    "line": {
      "max": "l",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "borders, edges, arrows, axes, rules"
    },
    "line-strong": {
      "max": "l",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "emphasis border, connector on a tinted fill"
    },
    "surface-0": {
      "max": "f",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "quietest container fill"
    },
    "surface-1": {
      "max": "f",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "default shape / card fill"
    },
    "surface-2": {
      "max": "f",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "nested or selected container fill"
    },
    "cat-1": {
      "max": "tlf",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "category 1 — also the accent colour"
    },
    "cat-2": {
      "max": "tlf",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "category 2 — marks and lines only"
    },
    "cat-3": {
      "max": "tlf",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "category 3 — fill only; the family is too light for text or lines in any theme"
    },
    "cat-4": {
      "max": "tlf",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "category 4"
    },
    "cat-5": {
      "max": "tlf",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "category 5"
    },
    "cat-6": {
      "max": "tlf",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "category 6 — marks and lines only"
    },
    "cat-7": {
      "max": "tlf",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "category 7 — marks and lines only"
    },
    "cat-8": {
      "max": "tlf",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "category 8"
    },
    "positive": {
      "max": "tlf",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "gains, passes, healthy state"
    },
    "positive-ink": {
      "max": "tl",
      "sitsOn": "page",
      "role": "positive text and deltas"
    },
    "negative": {
      "max": "tlf",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "failures, regressions"
    },
    "negative-ink": {
      "max": "tl",
      "sitsOn": "page",
      "role": "negative text and deltas — the family shade, granted the text role so a red chip can carry red words"
    },
    "warning": {
      "max": "tlf",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "warning fill / band"
    },
    "warning-ink": {
      "max": "tl",
      "sitsOn": "page",
      "role": "warning text and threshold lines"
    },
    "target": {
      "max": "l",
      "sitsOn": "",
      "role": "dashed reference lines / goal markers"
    }
  },
